  },
  "answer": "",
  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "Factor a² − ab first. One factor is exactly what the hypothesis tells you about.",
    "a − b = nk, so a² − ab = a(a − b) = n·(something)."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Since $n \\mid (a - b)$, $a - b = nk$ for some integer $k$ (so $a = nk + b$).",
    "$a^2 - ab = a(a - b) = a(nk) = n(ak)$, and $ak$ is an integer, so $n \\mid (a^2 - ab)$. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
